<title>USA: Harrah's opens two casinos in Missouri.</title>
<headline>Harrah's opens two casinos in Missouri.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harrah's Entertainment Inc said on Tuesday it opened two floating casinos and a hotel in the St. Louis, Mo., suburb of Maryland Heights, Mo.</p>
<p>Harrah's Easy Street and Harrah's Mardi Gras casinos, located on adjoining barges, and a hotel are part of Riverport Casino Center, a 470,000 square-foot resort developed as a joint venture between subsidiaries of Harrah's and Players International Inc.</p>
<p>There are also two Players casinos in the Riverport Casino Center, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
